---
manual: common.width.nil_resets
lines: [2749, 2750]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @b = button "Click me"
end
----------- test code
natural = layout_of(button("@b")).w

button("@b").style(width: 300)
wait_frames
assert_in_delta 300, layout_of(button("@b")).w, 0.5

button("@b").style(width: nil)
wait_frames
assert_in_delta natural, layout_of(button("@b")).w, 0.5, "with the setting emptied Shoes picks the width again"
